al-berry-marriages-not-in-grooms-book"&gt;Additional Berry Marriages (not in Grooms Book)&lt;a class="anchor" href="#additional-berry-marriages-not-in-grooms-book"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;table&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;Last Name&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;First Name&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;Sp. Last Name&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;Sp. First Name&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/thead&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;tbody&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Annie&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Parker&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Monroe&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Dec 30 1875&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;John Dr.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Strayhorn&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Mary&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Oct 2 1876&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Emma G.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;John Saunders&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Oct 18 1884&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Willie P.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Wilson&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Ida Ann&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;June 2 1895&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Ada L.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Rogers&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Wlm. Jackson&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Sept 1 1895&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Cora&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Breeze&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;A. Frank&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Jun 26 1899&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Berry&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Willie A.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Hall&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Fannie J.&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;td&gt;Jun 3 1900&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;/tr&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Last Updated: 2015-01-24&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chapter 9: Thomas Berry 1770–Before 1812</title><link>https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch09-thomas-berry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch09-thomas-berry/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;header class="book-banner" role="banner"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="book-banner-title"&gt;Our Berrys in Frontier America&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="book-banner-author"&gt;by Benjamin Berry Henderson Sr.&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/header&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="book-chapter-nav"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch08-elizabeth-berry/"&gt;← Chapter 8: Elizabeth Berry&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/"&gt;Table of Contents&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch10-david-j-berry/"&gt;Chapter 10: David J. Berry →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ancestor Profile:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/thomas-berry/"&gt;Thomas Berry&lt;/a&gt; — view the full family profile on berrytree.org&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id="chapter-9"&gt;Chapter 9&lt;a class="anchor" href="#chapter-9"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="thomas-berry-1770--before-1812"&gt;Thomas Berry 1770 – Before 1812&lt;a class="anchor" href="#thomas-berry-1770--before-1812"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;It is almost impossible to write about Thomas Berry without including younger brother, William Berry, at the same time. The two brothers were involved in so many of life&amp;rsquo;s endeavors together. The William and Elizabeth Smith Cate family is a central point in both of their lives. Thomas and William Berry married two of their three daughters. This is a case of two brothers who married two sisters. This was not at all uncommon in the early days of our nation. William Berry married Hannah Cate first and Thomas married Sarah Cate a year later: It gets a lot more complicated after that.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hannah Cate Berry</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/hannahcateberry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/hannahcateberry/</guid><description>&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;Hannah Cate Berry&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Hannah Cate Berry"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-berry/"&gt;William Berry × Hannah Cate&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 3 (by marriage)&lt;/span&gt;&#10; Hannah Cate Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1770, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1858, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;William Berry — married August 12, 1799, Orange County, NC&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;William and Elizabeth Smith (Messersmith) Cate&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="the-story-of-hannah-cate-berry"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Story of Hannah Cate Berry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#the-story-of-hannah-cate-berry"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hannah Cate&lt;/strong&gt; was born in 1770 and she died in 1858 in Orange County, NC (1810 and 1850 Orange County Censuses; William Cate&amp;rsquo;s will, dated November 10, 1775, confirms children). Hannah Cate was the daughter of William and Elizabeth Smith (Messersmith) Cate.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sarah Cate Berry Pigg</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/sarah-cate/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/sarah-cate/</guid><description>&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;Sarah Cate Berry Pigg&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Sarah Cate Berry Pigg"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/sarah-cate/"&gt;Thomas Berry × Sarah Cate&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Wayne County, TN&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 3 (by marriage)&lt;/span&gt;&#10; Sarah Cate Berry Pigg&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;December 27, 1782, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;March 7, 1875, Wayne County, Tennessee&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1st: Thomas Berry — married August 11, 1800, Orange County, NC · 2nd: John Pigg — married December 11, 1815, Williamson County, TN&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;William Cate and Elizabeth Messersmith Cate&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="the-story-of-sarah-cate"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Story of Sarah Cate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#the-story-of-sarah-cate"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Sarah Cate was the daughter of William and Elizabeth Messersmith Cate and was born in North Carolina on December 27, 1782. Nothing is known about Sarah&amp;rsquo;s early life except that she had two brothers and two sisters. The brothers were John Cate and Benjamin Cate and her two sisters were Charity and Hannah Cate.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>William Clarence Berry NC, ALA, TX</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-clarence-berry-nc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-clarence-berry-nc/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;William Clarence Berry&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "William Clarence Berry"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-berry/"&gt;William Berry × Hannah Cate&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 4&lt;/span&gt;William Clarence Berry × Sally Bowles / Massa Ann Tompkins — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, AL → Burnet County, TX&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 4&lt;/span&gt;&#10; William Clarence Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;October 17, 1803, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;September 8, 1878, Burnet County, Texas&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1st: Sally Bowles (married November 20, 1826; died 1833) — 2nd: Massa Ann Tompkins (married 1836)&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;William Berry and Hannah Cate Berry, Orange County, NC&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="william-clarence-berry-son-of-william-and-hannah-cate-berry"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;William Clarence Berry, son of William and Hannah Cate Berry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#william-clarence-berry-son-of-william-and-hannah-cate-berry"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;William Clarence Berry&lt;/strong&gt; was born on October 17th 1803 in Orange County, North Carolina and died on 08 September 1878 in Burnet County Texas. &lt;!-- UNSOURCED --&gt; He and his two brothers were listed on &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/hannahcateberry/"&gt;Hannah Cate Berry&amp;rsquo;s&lt;/a&gt; 1810 census. The family was living in the old Patrick Rutherford plantation house which Robert Berry bought in 1787. They may have lived there for many years but Hannah did not list in the 1820 Orange County, NC, census.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Thomas Person Berry</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/thomas-person-berry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/thomas-person-berry/</guid><description>&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;Thomas Person Berry&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Thomas Person Berry"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-berry/"&gt;William Berry × Hannah Cate&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Tennessee&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/thomas-person-berry/"&gt;Thomas Person Berry × Sarah Lunsford&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 4&lt;/span&gt;&#10; Thomas Person Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;June 1, 1808, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;April 30, 1884, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;1st: Sarah Lunsford — married September 28, 1831 · 2nd: Lucy Brown — married August 24, 1871 · 3rd: Elizabeth Peed Bowles — married December 3, 1883&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;William Berry and Hannah Cate, Orange County, NC&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="the-story-of-thomas-person-berry"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Story of Thomas Person Berry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#the-story-of-thomas-person-berry"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="img-float img-float-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://berrytree.org/images/thomaspberrypicture.jpg" alt="Thomas Person Berry" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;Thomas Person Berry&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chapter 14: Thomas Person Berry 1808–1884</title><link>https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch14-thomas-person-berry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch14-thomas-person-berry/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;header class="book-banner" role="banner"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="book-banner-title"&gt;Our Berrys in Frontier America&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="book-banner-author"&gt;by Benjamin Berry Henderson Sr.&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/header&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="book-chapter-nav"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch12-henry-berry/"&gt;← Chapter 12: Henry Berry&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/"&gt;Table of Contents&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/books/frontier-america/ch15-john-robert-berry/"&gt;Chapter 15: John Robert Berry →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="chapter-14"&gt;Chapter 14&lt;a class="anchor" href="#chapter-14"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="thomas-person-berry-18081884"&gt;Thomas Person Berry 1808–1884&lt;a class="anchor" href="#thomas-person-berry-18081884"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="photo-feature"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/images/books/ch14-image189.jpeg"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://berrytree.org/images/books/ch14-image189.jpeg" alt="T.P. Berry marriage bond to Sarah Lunsford" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="photo-caption"&gt;T.P. Berry marriage bond to Sarah Lunsford&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Berry Marriage Bonds</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/marriages/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/marriages/</guid><description>&lt;div class="info-banner" role="banner"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="info-banner-title"&gt;Berry Marriage Bonds&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="info-banner-subtitle"&gt;Marriage bond records from the Grooms Book of Berry Marriages, now integrated into the Family Timeline.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The marriage bond data that was previously on this page has been migrated to the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timeline/"&gt;Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. All 39 Berry marriage bonds from the Grooms Book are now searchable and filterable using the &amp;ldquo;marriage&amp;rdquo; category filter on the timeline.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Elizabeth Berry Franklin</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/elizaberryfranklin/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/elizaberryfranklin/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="elizabeth-berry-franklin-daughter-of-john-berry-and-hannah-cate"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elizabeth Berry Franklin, daughter of John Berry and Hannah Cate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#elizabeth-berry-franklin-daughter-of-john-berry-and-hannah-cate"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gen 1&lt;/strong&gt; Robert Berry × Mary Williamson — Princess Anne County, Virginia&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gen 2&lt;/strong&gt; Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate — Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gen 3&lt;/strong&gt; William Berry × Hannah Cate — Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gen 4&lt;/strong&gt; Elizabeth Berry × Theodrick Franklin — Orange County, NC → Fayette County, Alabama&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elizabeth Berry was born in Orange County NC in 1812. &lt;!-- UNSOURCED --&gt; Hannah Cate Berry and John Berry were Elizabeth&amp;rsquo;s parents Elizabeth had three half brothers, &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/william-berry/"&gt;William Clarence Berry&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-c-berry-alabama/"&gt;Robert C. Berry&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/thomas-person-berry/"&gt;Thomas Person Berry&lt;/a&gt;. Temperance Jane Franklin was born in Orange County North Carolina in 1831.&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="img-float img-float-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://berrytree.org/images/temperancefranklinbiblepage.jpg" alt="Bible Page" /&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Temperance Jane Franklin naming her Mother, Elizabeth Berry, and her father, John Berry.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Robert Berry, Son of David J. and Mary Blalock</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robertdjberry/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robertdjberry/</guid><description>&lt;div class="ancestor-page"&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="You are here"&gt;&#10; &lt;ol&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"&gt;Ancestors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"&gt;Family Lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li aria-current="page"&gt;Robert Berry (David J. line)&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- Schema.org BreadcrumbList --&gt;&#10;&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;&#10;{&#10; "@context": "https://schema.org",&#10; "@type": "BreadcrumbList",&#10; "itemListElement": [&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://berrytree.org/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Ancestors", "item": "https://berrytree.org/ancestors/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Family Lines", "item": "https://berrytree.org/family-lines/"},&#10; {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 4, "name": "Robert Berry (David J. line)"}&#10; ]&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-chain"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 1&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-pac/"&gt;Robert Berry × Mary Williamson&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Princess Anne County, Virginia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 2&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry × Elizabeth Cate&lt;/a&gt;&#10; — Orange County, North Carolina&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/david-j-berry-sr/"&gt;David J. Berry × Mary Blalock&lt;/a&gt; — Orange County, NC → Georgia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="ancestor-line"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="gen-label"&gt;Gen 4&lt;/span&gt;Robert Berry × Eliza Everett — Orange County, NC → Fayette/Cobb County, Georgia&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="ancestor-profile"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-details"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="profile-name"&gt;&lt;span class="profile-gen"&gt;Generation 4&lt;/span&gt;&#10; Robert Berry&#10; &lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;dl class="vital-stats"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Born&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;August 2, 1812, Orange County, North Carolina&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Died&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Georgia&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Married&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;Eliza Everett (married June 16, 1833)&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="stat-row"&gt;&#10; &lt;dt&gt;Parents&lt;/dt&gt;&#10; &lt;dd&gt;David J. Berry and Mary Blalock&lt;/dd&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/dl&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="profile-timeline-link"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/timelines/"&gt;Explore in the Berry Family Timeline&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROBERT BERRY&lt;/strong&gt; was born on August 2, 1812 in Orange County North Carolina was named for his grandfather &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/robert-berry-oc/"&gt;Robert Berry&lt;/a&gt; who owned the Fiddleton Plantation. He was about sixteen years old when his father &lt;a href="https://berrytree.org/ancestors/david-j-berry-sr/"&gt;David J. Berry&lt;/a&gt; decided to remove the family to Georgia. Robert had an Uncle and some Berry Cousins in Fayette County Alabama, Wayne County Tennessee, and some Camp cousins in Georgia. David and his family apparently chose to settle near his sister, Mary Berry Camp&amp;rsquo;s children, in Fayette County Georgia. &lt;!-- UNSOURCED --&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>William Clarence Berry NC, ALA, TX</title><link>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/williamclarenceberrync/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://berrytree.org/ancestors/williamclarenceberrync/</guid><description>&lt;div class="info-banner" role="banner"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="info-banner-title"&gt;William Clarence Berry (1803–1877)&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="info-banner-subtitle"&gt;Son of William and Hannah Cate Berry, from Orange County NC to Fayette County Alabama and Burnet County Texas.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 id="william-clarence-berry-son-of-william-and-hannah-cate-berry-berry"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;William Clarence Berry, son of William and Hannah Cate Berry Berry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a class="anchor" href="#william-clarence-berry-son-of-william-and-hannah-cate-berry-berry"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;ANCESTORS&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Generation 1 Robert and Mary Williamson Berry VA&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>